#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:14
#: 0a15b935cef44a5582739da11f0c7cb9
msgid ""
"This article explains how to write up Plane's essential components when "
"using the :ref:`APM2.x Flight Controller <common-apm25-and-26-overview>`. "
"The instructions for adding other hardware are covered in :ref:`Optional "
"Hardware <common-optional-hardware>`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍在使用 :ref:`APM2.x 飞控 <common-apm25-and-26-overview>` 时如何连接 Plane "
"的基本组件。添加其他硬件的说明见 :ref:`可选硬件 <common-optional-hardware>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:19
#: c6a942c42aa847968fb5c030b230a8ac
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:21
#: 7fce4107f02e45e99b5c895b397172fd
msgid ""
"Turning a RC plane into a UAV is essentially just a matter of putting an "
"autopilot between the RC receiver and the aircraft's servos, so the "
"autopilot can take over control."
msgstr "将 RC 飞机变为 UAV 本质上只是在 RC 接收机和飞机舵机之间插入一个飞控，让飞控接管控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:25
#: 03eafc8983194219a4c6eb00485bae15
msgid ""
"The way we do that is to plug female-to-female cables from the RC receiver "
"into APM2's inputs, and plug the servos (and motor controller for electric "
"aircraft) into APM2's outputs."
msgstr "做法是将母对母线缆从 RC 接收机连接到 APM2 的输入端，并将舵机（以及电动飞机的电调）连接到 APM2 的输出端。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:29
#: 61e62ab4e8f046898efc0ef7db5e5f7f
msgid "What you'll need:"
msgstr "所需物品："

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:31
#: 85579ca2369f465994eef30f7892f04d
msgid "At least a 5-channel RC unit. 7 channels or more is highly recommended"
msgstr "至少 5 通道 RC 设备，强烈建议使用 7 通道或更多"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:33
#: 0560d6ffa4634e1fb6bccf726163fb93
msgid ""
"Female-to female cables for each channel you'll be using. `These "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/Servo_Extension_10cm_FF_p/cblsrvff10.htm>`__ are "
"fine."
msgstr ""
"每个通道使用母对母线缆。`这些 "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/Servo_Extension_10cm_FF_p/cblsrvff10.htm>`__ 均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:36
#: 15962b98a0a247918391240db3245d6e
msgid ""
"For APM2.0 you will need a power source. For electric aircraft, this is "
"usually the ESC. For gas/nitro powered planes, your radio will need its own "
"battery/BEC. ArduPilot Mega normally gets its power from the RC system."
msgstr ""
"APM2.0 需要电源。对于电动飞机，通常由 ESC 提供。对于油动/甲醇动力飞机，遥控器需要自带电池/BEC。ArduPilot Mega 通常从 "
"RC 系统获取电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:40
#: 985ac4d0cb8f42fa9d62988215d5d08e
msgid "For APM2.5 you can use the supplied APM Power Module for the power"
msgstr "APM2.5 可使用附带的 APM 电源模块供电"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:44
#: 1c521f3c74b24d4cbdad55b3a122a352
msgid "You still need an ESC or BEC to power the servos"
msgstr "仍需要 ESC 或 BEC 为舵机供电"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:46
#: 104fa3c15e6c43ed8e061950a408bc68
msgid "."
msgstr "."

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:50
#: 15c0f6c1cfc24ed7ae43e307c6851bca
msgid ""
"You can also power APM 2 from the USB cable. However, this will not power "
"the RC output pins, so if you want to see servos move while testing APM 2 on"
" the bench, you'll need to connect a battery (through an ESC) to one of the "
"output channels. It's fine to have both an ESC and the USB cable connected "
"at the same time."
msgstr ""
"也可通过 USB 线缆为 APM 2 供电。但这不会为 RC 输出引脚供电，因此如果想在桌面测试 APM 2 时看到舵机运动，需要通过 ESC "
"将电池连接到某个输出通道。同时连接 ESC 和 USB 线缆是没有问题的。"

