msgid "Inputs"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:72
#: 6f14dd0577814287a845bb7ec2aa3750
msgid ""
"Connect your RC receiver to APM2's Inputs with female-to-female cables in "
"the order shown above. Each channel that you want APM to control should be "
"connected to an Input on the APM board. Typically, the Mode Switch (APM "
"Input 8 for !Plane) is connected to any RC receiver channel that you have "
"assigned to a three-position toggle switch on your RC transmitter (for most "
"people, that's channel 5)."
msgstr ""
"使用母对母线缆按上图所示顺序将 RC 接收机连接到 APM2 的输入端。希望 APM 控制的每个通道都应连接到 APM "
"板上的输入端。通常，模式开关（APM Plane 的输入 8）连接到遥控器上分配给三档拨动开关的任意 RC 接收机通道（大多数人使用通道 5）。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:81
#: 7f283dc58f0a4969aa43d31f2df43f25
msgid ""
"These instructions are for Plane. Copter's mode switch goes to APM input 5, "
"not input 8"
msgstr "这些说明适用于 Plane。ArduCopter 的模式开关连接到 APM 输入 5，而非输入 8"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:84
#: 108091ea4c804dd5886a21e8e6e1a704
msgid ""
"The ground (black) side of each connector should be on the outside, closest "
"to the edge of the board, as shown here with either straight or right-angle "
"connectors:"
msgstr "每个连接器的地线（黑色）应在外侧，靠近板边，如图所示，使用直插或直角连接器均可："

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:94
#: 5cbe8f4181ec49169f955f678a056adb
msgid ""
"See also :ref:`Connecting the Radio Receiver <common-connecting-the-radio-"
"receiver-apm2>`."
msgstr "另请参阅 :ref:`连接无线电接收机 <common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:98
#: b1b90c6a9cdd4001bf3a8afec5a0ad4b
msgid ""
"Elevons (combined ailerons/elevator, as used in flying wings) are also "
"supported' just connect them to the first two channels as you would to your "
"RC receiver. You'll :ref:`tell APM to do elevon mixing <reversing-servos-"
"and-setting-normalelevon-mode>` in the Mission Planner setup process."
msgstr ""
"升降副翼（组合副翼/升降舵，用于飞翼）也受支持，只需像连接 RC 接收机一样将其连接到前两个通道。之后在 Mission Planner 设置过程中 "
":ref:`告知 APM 进行升降副翼混控 <reversing-servos-and-setting-normalelevon-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:103
#: f6f702233f244dcd9bcc3395c48fde7a
msgid ""
"If you're flying a V-tail, please see the ``VTAIL_OUTPUT``. option in the "
":ref:`servo setup documentation <reversing-servos-and-setting-normalelevon-"
"mode>`."
msgstr ""
"如果飞 V 型尾翼，请参阅 :ref:`舵机设置文档 <reversing-servos-and-setting-normalelevon-mode>`"
" 中的 ``VTAIL_OUTPUT`` 选项。"

