#: aa3feec686d04e8b8a00a87b09b0b19e
msgid "Installing it in your plane"
msgstr "安装到飞机中"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:207
#: e600a8b04e2f47d793fc94737bae69f5
msgid ""
"When you place APM in your aircraft, it is very important that it face the "
"right way. The GPS connector should face forward, and the servo cables face "
"back. The board must also be right side up, with the IMU shield at the top. "
"Like this (note: there's a little arrow on the bottom of the shield that "
"point to the front, too, in case you need a reminder at the field):"
msgstr ""
"将 APM 放入飞机时，朝向非常重要。GPS 连接器应朝前，舵机线缆朝后。主板也必须正面朝上，IMU "
"屏蔽罩位于顶部。如图所示（注意：屏蔽罩底部有一个小箭头指向前方，在野外时可作提醒）："

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:217
#: 5d783a57334e4a37981b570ad7e3ba87
msgid ""
"When putting APM in your plane, it's important to ensure that it's solidly "
"mounted and doesn't move around in flight. It should also be as close as "
"possible to level when the plane is in its flying orientation. Ideally, "
"you'll want to have it as close to the center of gravity as you can (that's "
"where vibration is the least) and mounted on foam tape onto a solid "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"将 APM 安装到飞机中时，务必确保其安装牢固，飞行时不会移动。在飞机飞行姿态下，APM "
"应尽可能接近水平。理想情况下，应尽量靠近重心安装（震动最小的位置），并用泡沫双面胶固定在坚固的平台上。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:225
#: b7d60f714ce04bbdb0076eefb3cacbdf
msgid "Connecting GPS Module"
msgstr "连接 GPS 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:227
#: a0294c2559734b5f98ba78e861948b9c
msgid ""
"A GPS module provides enhanced positioning for autonomous flight. Connecting"
" your GPS to your autopilot by following these steps."
msgstr "GPS 模块可为自主飞行提供增强定位。请按以下步骤将 GPS 连接到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:231
#: 310d63ddd7fc4c938fadef7fc2a4978b
msgid "3DR GPS uBlox with Onboard Compass"
msgstr "3DR GPS uBlox（带板载罗盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:233
#: a04b6358f4e34b14b2319cb74c2ce70e
msgid ""
"3DR GPS uBlox with Onboard Compass is intended for use with APM 2.5 (for "
"external compass). It provides enhanced compass performance because of the "
"freedom to situate the GPS unit in an optimal position independent of the "
"location of the APM. Place your GPS on the outside of your plane with a "
"clear view of the sky, as far as possible from the motor and ESC, with the "
"arrow facing forward."
msgstr ""
"3DR GPS uBlox（带板载罗盘）适用于 APM 2.5（用于外部罗盘）。由于可以将 GPS 模块放置在独立于 APM "
"位置的最佳位置，因此可提供更好的罗盘性能。请将 GPS 放置在飞机外部能清晰看到天空的位置，尽可能远离电机和 ESC，箭头朝前。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:243
#: ca7af95a4c354d1cbac4b71e99f569eb
msgid ""
"Connect the GPS module to the APM 2.6 using the two cables included with the"
" GPS as shown below."
msgstr "使用 GPS 附带的两根线缆将 GPS 模块连接到 APM 2.6，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:249
#: 97add58e167240379d73ea04b994ba4a
msgid ""
"3DR GPS uBlox with Onboard Compass includes two connector cables: one "
"4-position cable and one 5-position-to-6-position cable. To connect the GPS "
"module to APM 2.6, connect the GPS to the APM GPS port using the 5-position-"
"to-6-position cable; connect the GPS to the APM I2C port using the "
"4-position cable."
msgstr ""
"3DR GPS uBlox（带板载罗盘）包含两根连接线缆：一根 4 芯线缆和一根 5 转 6 芯线缆。将 GPS 模块连接到 APM 2.6 时，使用 "
"5 转 6 芯线缆将 GPS 连接到 APM GPS 端口；使用 4 芯线缆将 GPS 连接到 APM I2C 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:256
#: 337a99234332483f97bfba7422634460
msgid "3DR GPS uBlox without Onboard Compass"
msgstr "3DR GPS uBlox（不带板载罗盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:258
#: e6318b38bd9c46a998666fedf079c641
msgid ""
"3DR GPS uBlox without Onboard Compass is intended for use with APM 2.5. To "
"install your GPS module without compass, mount to the outside of your plane "
"with a clear view of the sky and connect to the APM 2.5 GPS port using the "
"5-position-to-6-position connector cable."
msgstr ""
"3DR GPS uBlox（不带板载罗盘）适用于 APM 2.5。安装不带罗盘的 GPS 模块时，请将其安装在飞机外部能清晰看到天空的位置，并使用 5 "
"转 6 芯连接线缆连接到 APM 2.5 的 GPS 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:267
#: 6693b6bf41c2424bbb0daa5b34e11706
msgid "Tips on mounting the GPS module"
msgstr "GPS 模块安装技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:269
#: b58293f0c4564431b6839e54ec69c2e7
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter which way the GPS module is oriented, as long as the "
"square antenna side is facing up"
msgstr "GPS 模块的朝向无关紧要，只要方形天线面朝上即可"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:271
#: 904b28d8486f4c2e9a7a6e1b420fb146
msgid ""
"It's best to mount the GPS as far away from radio transmission equipment "
"(like your telemetry or video transmitters) as possible."
msgstr "最好将 GPS 尽可能远离无线电发射设备（如数传或图传发射机）安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:273
#: 6b601cf2466b48de9521bbf70838e87f
msgid ""
"Ideally, the GPS module will have a clear view of the sky. On top of your "
"plane is a good choice."
msgstr "理想情况下，GPS 模块应能清晰看到天空。安装在飞机顶部是个不错的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-apm2x-wiring-quickstart.rst:276
#: 785b6eccc00143fc84a974b6a4da06e5
msgid ""
"Here's an example of one way to mount APM (and the GPS module) in an "
"EasyStar using the `3D Robotics Electronics Chassis "
"<http://www.amazon.co.uk/Electronics-Chassis-Kit-Bixler-"
"SkySurfer/dp/B00FNPACBO#>`__ for the `HobbyKing Bixler "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__16544__Hobbyking_Bixler_EPO_1400mm_ARF_.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"以下是在 EasyStar 上安装 APM（和 GPS 模块）的一种方式，使用适用于 `HobbyKing Bixler "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__16544__Hobbyking_Bixler_EPO_1400mm_ARF_.html>`__"
" 的 `3D Robotics 电子底盘 <http://www.amazon.co.uk/Electronics-Chassis-Kit-"
"Bixler-SkySurfer/dp/B00FNPACBO#>`__。"

